<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 108 0 R/E(This project aims to develop a secure LI-FI data transmission system that sends photos,and text via light. Using  laser diodes as transmitters and Solar Panel as receivers, data is encoded into light pulses. Enabling efficient transmission of  files .)/Pg 14 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

