235 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 111 0 R/E(In Phase 1, the goal is to establish a fundamental data transmission system using a laser as the carrier signal. This phase involves constructing the basic circuit and testing the laser-based link for stability in transmitting simple binary data.)/Alt()/Pg 17 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

236 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 111 0 R/E(Basic Signal Transmission)/Alt()/Pg 17 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

237 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 612 0 R/E(Transmit simple binary sequences \(e.g., alternating 0s and 1s\) to confirm that the laser modulates as expected.)/Alt()/Pg 17 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

238 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 613 0 R/E(Validate that the receiver can detect these sequences accurately by monitoring the Arduino\220s output.)/Alt()/Pg 17 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

239 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 614 0 R/E(Fine-tune laser brightness and receiver sensitivity, if needed, to ensure a stable, readable signal.)/Alt()/Pg 17 0 R/K[7]>>
