<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 619 0 R/E(The establishment of a stable laser communication link between transmitter and receiver.)/Alt()/Pg 17 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

247 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 620 0 R/E(Successful detection and accurate interpretation of basic binary sequences on the receiver side, confirming the link\220s initial stability.)/Alt()/Pg 17 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

