270 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 632 0 R/E(The primary issue observed is the inability of the receiver Arduino to consistently interpret the incoming signal. This may be due to weak signal strength, improper threshold detection, or noise from ambient light.)/Alt()/Pg 19 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

