<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 634 0 R/E(Calibrate the Arduino\220s analog input readings by setting a voltage threshold that distinguishes a binary \2171\220 from a binary \2170\220. This threshold is set to around 660mV to match the laser's wavelength \(~660nm\) and ensure accurate signal detection.)/Alt()/Pg 19 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

